{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-10-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK RECEIVES CLIMATE LEADERSHIP AWARD FOR PROGRESS IN REDUCING GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS', 'text': "DALLAS, OCT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KIMBERLY-CLARK TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT RECEIVED A 2021 CLIMATE LEADERSHIP AWARD FOR 'GOAL ACHIEVEMENT IN GREENHOUSE GAS MANAGEMENT' FROM THE CENTER FOR CLIMATE AND ENERGY SOLUTIONS AND THE CLIMATE REGISTRY. THE NATIONAL AWARD RECOGNIZES COMPANIES THAT SET AND ACHIEVE AGGRESSIVE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) REDUCTION GOALS."}